      "text": "Day 3 · Breakfast and transfer to your hotel in Porto de Galinhas, about 60 km south of Recife. This former fishing village is known for its magnificent beaches, among the most beautiful in Brazil: clear turquoise water, white sand and coconut palms along the shore. Time to rest.",
